Alright, now that the latest news has been talked about, let’s talk about mod characters
Now, I was originally going to have categories for each mod character and then make a blog post for each category
Some categories I would have done include, but are not limited to, most powerful characters and the characters with the most sex appeal
But considering those types of posts have been done to death, I’m just gonna list characters whenever I want 

The first character from the FNF mods is a HUGE fan-favorite, to the point where some have considered them to be part of the actual game itself
I’m of course talking about Whitty, the bomb humanoid character with the huge grudge against Daddy Dearest
Not only does he look amazing and fit the style of FNF to a T, but he’s also quite tall
Dude easily surpasses 7 ft with his structure, although he has a sort of back-bend thing going for him that makes him appear shorter (but not by much)
All of Whitty’s many forms I love, including his Ballistic form, and I can’t imagine a world without them as a FNF mod character

The next character I want to talk about is one who has seemingly gained a huge following online, despite being a side-character
I’m, of course, talking about the hot moth created by RetroSpecter, Sakuroma (or Sakumora, whatever the spelling of her name is)
While I love Whitty because of his power and personality, I love Sakuroma for her raw sex appeal (if I was doing categories, she would be at the top at that list)
She’s also a cheerleader for the big wolf himself, only an opponent because he needed to take a break and needed someone to fill in
I adore her personality as well, don’t get me wrong there, but mostly her looks and her ever-serving fanart is what I love about her
I guess I really am judging a book by its cover, but whatever, it’s my opinion

The final character to be discussed (yes, this is still gonna be a series) is one that I’ve recently starting playing the mod for
She’s an alien from another world, crash-landing onto Earth for the sole purpose of having a blast and making remixes of popular songs
I’m referring to Saruky’s bestest character he ever made, Nikku
Hotline 024 might just be one of the best and most diverse mods ever created, and Nikku just further proves my point
In this case, I’m loving the character because of the mod they’re in and the role(s) they play in it
It’s no wonder Saruky got invited to work on the FNF team, what with developing and beat-making skills such as his.

